 young girl with an SOS from the third ship they call home. He thus decides to put an end to a long-standing feud in order to protect those dear to him.\n\nJust as the pieces of the story begin falling back together again, the planet receives a message from the far reaches of outer space: “We are a fleet of colony ships from Earth... Those who wish may accompany us to a new frontier.” The entire population rejoices at this news. However, as if to mock their celebration, the one-winged angel returns to wreak havoc and despair. Fates collide to forge a final conclusion for the panicked planet.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"},"tags":[{"name":"Dystopian","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Full CGI","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Desert","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Guns","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":73,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Steampunk","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dissociative Identities","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":53,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":53,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":30,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"TRIGUN STARGAZE","english":"TRIGUN STARGAZE","native":"TRIGUN STARGAZE","romaji":"TRIGUN STARGAZE","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"枪神 观星之人"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"TRIGUN STAMPEDE シリーズ完結編"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"枪神 斯坦比特 系列完结篇"}]},"trailer":{"id":"JBYLkW--zmI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JBYLkW--zmI/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}